{
    "comment": "목록 위의 카테고리 칩 판 — 고른 깊이까지만 하위 줄이 펼쳐진다. 칩을 누르면 쿼리를 바꾸는 것이 아니라\n     **그 카테고리 화면으로 이동**하고(`/category/{slug}`), 지금 위치는 `d1`~`d3` 쿼리로 표시된다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "카테고리 필터 (토글 접기/펼치기, 4단계 카테고리 칩)"
    },
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "props": {
        "className": "mb-4 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "comment": "토글 헤더",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Button",
            "actions": [
                {
                    "type": "click",
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": {
                        "target": "local",
                        "categoryFilterOpen": "{{_local.categoryFilterOpen === false ? true : false}}"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "props": {
                "className": "w-full flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/80 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-t-lg border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 transition-colors"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex items-center gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "filter",
                                "className": "text-base text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "$t:shop.category_filter"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "펼침 아이콘",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Icon",
                    "if": "{{_local.categoryFilterOpen !== false}}",
                    "props": {
                        "name": "chevron-up",
                        "className": "text-base"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "comment": "접힘 아이콘",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Icon",
                    "if": "{{_local.categoryFilterOpen === false}}",
                    "props": {
                        "name": "chevron-down",
                        "className": "text-base"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "comment": "카테고리 칩 영역 (펼침 시에만 표시)",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{_local.categoryFilterOpen !== false}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "px-4 py-4 space-y-3"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "comment": "1단계 카테고리 칩 (항상 표시)",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex flex-wrap gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "전체 — 빈 `<query/>` 로 이동해 카테고리 깊이·검색·쪽수를 한꺼번에 떨군다",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "navigate",
                                    "params": {
                                        "path": "{{_global.shopBase}}/products",
                                        "query": {}
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "className": "{{!query.category || query.category === 'all' ? 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-full text-sm font-medium' : 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-600'}}"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:shop.category.all"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "iteration": {
                                "source": "{{categories?.data ?? []}}",
                                "item_var": "cat"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "navigate",
                                            "params": {
                                                "path": "{{_global.shopBase}}/category/{{cat?.slug}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{query.d1 == cat.id ? 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-full text-sm font-medium' : 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-600'}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{cat?.name_localized}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "2단계 하위 카테고리 (d1 선택 시)",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!!query.d1 && ((categories?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d1)?.children ?? []).length > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "pl-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "turn-up",
                                "className": "text-base text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 rotate-90 flex-shrink-0 mt-1 ml-2"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "iteration": {
                                "source": "{{(categories?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d1)?.children ?? []}}",
                                "item_var": "sub2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "navigate",
                                            "params": {
                                                "path": "{{_global.shopBase}}/category/{{sub2?.slug}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{query.d2 == sub2?.id ? 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-full text-sm font-medium' : 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-600'}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{sub2?.name_localized}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "3단계 하위 카테고리 (d2 선택 시)",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!!query.d2 && (((categories?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d1)?.children ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d2)?.children ?? []).length > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "pl-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "turn-up",
                                "className": "text-base text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 rotate-90 flex-shrink-0 mt-1 ml-2"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "iteration": {
                                "source": "{{((categories?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d1)?.children ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d2)?.children ?? []}}",
                                "item_var": "sub3"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "navigate",
                                            "params": {
                                                "path": "{{_global.shopBase}}/category/{{sub3?.slug}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{query.d3 == sub3?.id ? 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-full text-sm font-medium' : 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-600'}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{sub3?.name_localized}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "4단계 하위 카테고리 (d3 선택, category == d3)",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!!query.d3 && query.category == query.d3 && ((((categories?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d1)?.children ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d2)?.children ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d3)?.children ?? []).length > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "pl-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "turn-up",
                                "className": "text-base text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 rotate-90 flex-shrink-0 mt-1 ml-2"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "iteration": {
                                "source": "{{(((categories?.data ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d1)?.children ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d2)?.children ?? []).find(c => c.id == query.d3)?.children ?? []}}",
                                "item_var": "sub4"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "navigate",
                                            "params": {
                                                "path": "{{_global.shopBase}}/category/{{sub4?.slug}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{query.category == sub4?.id ? 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-full text-sm font-medium' : 'px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-600'}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{sub4?.name_localized}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
